WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:05,850
This damn driver took advantage of me while I was sleeping

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,290
Drag me to a place where birds don't shit

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,930
He said it was a stomach ache and went to get it sorted out.

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,130
I kept asking for a long time and still didn’t reply.

5
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,370
He won't drown, right?

6
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,970
I'll give you a bottle when I get back

7
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,650
I haven't eaten for more than 20 hours

8
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:15,730
Almost starving to death

9
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:20,150
fish steak perverted soles

10
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:38,290
How spicy can fish tail be?

11
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:46,620
Bitch, I'm here to lock your life away

12
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,260
The more I am afraid of ghosts in the forest, the more I don’t eat spicy food.

13
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,780
Add antidote to water

14
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,100
It must be crying and screaming in the car right now

15
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,780
It's everywhere

16
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:56,060
Let it bully Rainbow Dash

17
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:58,830
I want it to look good

18
00:00:58,830 --> 00:01:01,980
Lin Jingque, you are excellent

19
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,060
I originally planned to find someone

20
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:04,850
Beat Lin Bian Yue up

21
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:07,910
Still not as good as the eldest lady

22
00:01:07,910 --> 00:01:09,590
I am not only excellent but also beautiful

23
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,110
when you laugh
